# Reset the suffix inherited from stage2's EXPORT_IMAGE, which sets
# IMG_SUFFIX="-lite".  pi-gen sources each stage's EXPORT_IMAGE in turn and
# IMG_SUFFIX is exported, so leaving this file empty meant our image was named
# "<date>-CybICS-lite" as well -- the same filename as the plain Lite export,
# which it then silently overwrote in deploy/.  The image that shipped was the
# right one only because stage-cybics happens to export last.
IMG_SUFFIX=""
